[I] Non-blocking I/O library of syslog-ng 1

[T] Libol is a small C support library similar to GLib, providing the non-
[T] blocking I/O and object system used by syslog-ng 1.x.

[U] https://www.balabit.hu/en/downloads/syslog-ng/

